abstract: >
  Reproducibility front door for the seam-stitched empirical study of
  phase-locked extreme compression in adjacent Riemann zeta-zero spacing,
  including paper source, lightweight analysis code, and summary artifacts
  for broad-board ablations, terminal 52k/8k/1k comparators, matched-packet
  nulls, and jackknife robustness audits.
